init-descriptor-large = XML descriptor exceeds the 64 MiB limit: { $path }.
init-git-invalid = Cannot use the existing Git metadata at { $path }. Bare repositories are not supported; check the repository or use --no-vcs.
init-source-changed = Detected source parameters changed during selection: { $path }. Run init again.
init-source-path-invalid = --source must be a nonempty relative directory path without "..".
init-config-error = Could not serialize the project configuration.
